## Limits

- Tested on one macOS machine only. File watching on Windows and Linux was not covered.
- The watched folder held only test files; a large index with hundreds of thousands of files was not covered.
- The test apps are minimal `.app` bundles with an `Info.plist` and a placeholder executable.
- No heap snapshot was taken, so it is not confirmed that the first-half memory growth is all cache warm-up.
